--  Upload, then Run. Creates its objects (HDR_..., HADER_...) in the workspace schema; safe to run again.
--  The background job needs the CREATE JOB privilege (APEX workspace schemas usually have it).
--  Then, to try the plug-ins with a sample company:   BEGIN HDR_DEMO.load; END;
